.TH SIMRV-ACT 1 "November 2026" "SimRV 3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
simrv-act \- run the RISC-V RVA23 Architecture Certification Tests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B simrv-act
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ --elf-dir DIR ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B simrv-act
runs generated ACT4 ELF tests using SimRV and writes a JSON test report.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-elf-dir \fIPATH\fR
Directory containing generated ACT4 ELF files. Required.
.TP
.B \-\-simrv \fIPATH\fR
Select the SimRV executable.
.TP
.B \-\-report \fIPATH\fR
Write the evaluation report as JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-jobs, \-j \fIN\fR
Set the number of parallel test jobs.
.TP
.B \-\-vlen \fIBITS\fR, \-\-timeout \fISECONDS\fR
Set the vector register length or timeout for each test.
.TP
.B \-\-max-failures \fIN\fR
Limit the number of failure details printed.
.TP
.B \-\-filter \fIPATTERN\fR
Run only ELF files whose names contain this pattern.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display help and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR simrv (1)
